	(text "MCP23S08: SPI mode 0 slave on the main bus (CS from the decoder). SO releases within 100 ns of CS rising (datasheet Fig. 2-6, parameter 14), so it shares SPI_MISO without a buffer. A1/A0 low: opcodes 0x40 / 0x41."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c884c95-a64d-5ab9-8629-79907c8bcb37")
	)
	(text "All pins power up as inputs. RESET, A1 and A0 must be biased (datasheet Table 1-1). Exposed pad to VSS, in addition to pin 17. GP7 is spare; firmware enables a weak pull-up on it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ecdbdf9-776d-5b10-9293-262d613d3b2e")
	)
	(text "The ADT7320 INT and CT outputs drive GP2 and GP3, the universal I/O expander interrupt GP4 and the I/O ADC data-ready GP5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
